 2. 💼 Exclusive: New Business Council chair
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Goldman Sachs CEO David Solomon speaks in New York on Sept. 20. Photo: Michael Nagle/Bloomberg via Getty Images 💼 Goldman Sachs CEO David Solomon will be the next chair of the Business Council, Axios' Courtenay Brown writes from an announcement shared exclusively with Axios. 

 The Business Council is an influential, invitation-only forum where top CEOs exchange views on corporate America's biggest issues. 🤝 Solomon will succeed Target executive chair Brian Cornell, who has led the organization since 2024.

 He will serve a two-year term. 🚀 What we're watching: Business Council CEO Marlene Colucci said Solomon's work on AI at Goldman Sachs will be valuable as members navigate technological change.

