 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Pope Leo XIV celebrates Mass at a Rome hospital today as he recovers from surgery. Photo: Vatican Media/AP 🇻🇦 The Vatican released the first images of Pope Leo XIV since his lung cancer surgery, adding that recent tests show "continued improvement" in his condition , AP reports . 🚓 A 16-year-old shooter who killed three children and a teacher at a Bend, Oregon, elementary school yesterday was shot by a citizen at the scene who followed him inside, police said. Go deeper . 🏀 The NBA and multiple sportsbooks have agreed to ban certain types of bets, including parlays used in betting scandals, as the NBA looks to crack down on gambling controversies, ESPN reports . 
 
