 4. 🎉 1 fun thing: Taco Bell&#x27;s birthday cake 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Taco Bell's new Milk Bar Birthday Cake Empanada. Photo: Taco Bell 🎂 Taco Bell has officially released its ( deep breath ) Milk Bar Birthday Cake Empanada.

 The sweet empanada, which became available yesterday for a limited time, features pink frosting, rainbow sprinkles and birthday cake filling. 🌮 The snazzy food item comes after Taco Bell sales sharply tanked over the summer due to the cyclospora outbreak .

 Yum CEO Chris Turner said in July that the "magic formula" of "brand buzz, innovation, value and digital" would help Taco Bell rebound. 💭 Thought bubble from Herb: My birthday is next week. I will be eating this.

 
 
